{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1120612001:1":{"text":"这就是手稿里标记的地方吗？可这里什么也没有……","source_cn":"这就是手稿里标记的地方吗？可这里什么也没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x515AE689388C24A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120612002:1":{"text":"除了沙子，还是沙子。","source_cn":"除了沙子，还是沙子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x595949EACC813411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120612003:1":{"text":"还记得那些匪徒提到寻宝仓鼠的事吗？他们为什么会笃定咱们的恩人是宝藏猎人？","source_cn":"还记得那些匪徒提到寻宝仓鼠的事吗？他们为什么会笃定咱们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EAA9B53B29A12F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120612004:1":{"text":"当然是因为……你是说，宝藏可能藏在地下？","source_cn":"当然是因为……你是说，宝藏可能藏在地下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FA379195DBD4A62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120612005:1":{"text":"虽然不能确定，但我们可以在这附近挖挖看。","source_cn":"虽然不能确定，但我们可以在这附近挖挖看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE7D3634C50A2335","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},